  "interpretation": "Ten measured frames, two warmup, one repeat, instrumented release. Phase values are arithmetic means; host values are medians. Sampling/rest and draw preparation are separate calls inside host recording. Draw palette includes palette total, which includes global matrices. Platform draw includes resource preparation, render steps and retirement; render steps includes draw_shaded, texture_for and made_texture. made_texture includes backend creation/upload plus retained-memory bookkeeping. Counts are exact. Timing includes instrumentation overhead and a P8→P0 transition, so this is attribution evidence rather than comparative performance proof. GPU timer starts before render steps; on-demand palette upload/creation inside draw_shaded therefore contributes to its GPU interval and can expose CPU/driver work.",
